      <Property name="English" value="&lt;NEU_AVG&gt;Upon approaching the entity, Cronus questions if we have met  before, explaining...&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&quot;Hmm... Nada and Polo sometimes change things. Granted, it&apos;s usually for the better. And recently, an alchemist has been bringing in shipments of&lt;&gt;  &lt;FLORA&gt;NipNip Buds&lt;&gt;. What a fascinating plant... Does wonders for my  mood, terrible on my memory.&quot;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;NEU_AVG&gt;Their attention drifts for a moment, before snapping back to  the conversation.&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&quot;Oh, right! Greetings and salutations Traveler! I am the iteration known  as Cronus. Trader in rare cuisine, professional food critic, and  amaetuer whalesong tracker.&quot;" />
