      <Property name="English" value="&lt;NEU_AVG&gt;The Chef&apos;s voice trails off as they pull seemingly random food  items from crates scattered throughout the market stall. You try to make  note of the recipe but Cronus never measures a single ingredient as they  weave from one&lt;&gt; &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Nutrient Processor&lt;&gt; &lt;NEU_AVG&gt;to the next.&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;NEU_AVG&gt;Finally, placed before you is a gently-baked&lt;&gt; &lt;SPECIAL&gt;meringue&lt;&gt;,  &lt;NEU_AVG&gt;a bowl of&lt;&gt; &lt;SPECIAL&gt;custard&lt;&gt;&lt;NEU_AVG&gt;, and small dish of&lt;&gt;  &lt;SPECIAL&gt;jam&lt;&gt; &lt;NEU_AVG&gt;that changes color whenever you look away.&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&quot;The &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Nutrient Processors&lt;&gt; would get this last part wrong.&quot; &lt;NEU_AVG&gt;Cronus expains,&lt;&gt; &quot;Each &lt;SPECIAL&gt;offering&lt;&gt; is different. It wants to sing, and you must help it find it&apos;s voice.&quot;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;NEU_AVG&gt;As Cronus sculpts the &lt;&gt;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;offering&apos;s&lt;&gt; &lt;NEU_AVG&gt;final  form, a hum begins to resonates from the dessert before you. The hum  becomes a voice, then the voice becomes a chorus. Barely audible but  always present.&lt;&gt; &#xA;&#xA;&lt;VISOR&gt;You wonder if you have you heard this song before.&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&quot;There you go, my friend! I can modestly say that it is one of my finest  desserts yet.Now, if you would be so kind, it would like to  &lt;SPECIAL&gt;harmonize&lt;&gt; with the stars.&quot;" />
