      <Property name="Id" value="UI_P_CHEF_SONG_DESC" />
      <Property name="English" value="A highly refined food product whose recipe was composed by &lt;HIGHLIGHT&gt;Iteration Cronus&lt;&gt; to attune to the memories found in the wake of &lt;RARE&gt;cosmic megafauna&lt;&gt;. When the  &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Forgotten Song&lt;&gt; finds harmony with &lt;VISOR&gt;WHALESONG&lt;&gt;, time can be witnessed unbound. &#xA;&#xA;&lt;STELLAR&gt;You can faintly hear a chorus of voices reaching out to the depths of space.&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Use Harmonize (&lt;IMG&gt;FE_ALT1&lt;&gt;) while in &lt;SPECIAL&gt;deep space&lt;&gt; to broadcast  an invitation for a harmonic partner." />
